WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.450
Ateliê Verde connects the customer experience with
gardening and landscaping management.

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:12.175
A project developed by Leandro Augusto Ferreira,
featuring a store, services, projects and Rafinha, the
virtual assistant.

3
00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:19.683
In the store, customers find plants, pots, tools and
accessories in organized categories.

4
00:00:19.683 --> 00:00:25.283
The interface brings products and services together,
with photos and information to help customers choose.

5
00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:32.392
Filters help customers find products by category, light
conditions, environment and plant type.

6
00:00:32.392 --> 00:00:36.592
Search and growing information make browsing more
practical.

7
00:00:37.642 --> 00:00:42.902
On the product page, customers can enlarge photos and
read about plant care.

8
00:00:42.902 --> 00:00:48.452
Accessories also have individual images, such as this
green two-liter watering can.

9
00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:56.000
The services area offers pruning, irrigation, garden
installation and consulting.

10
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.100
Customers can learn about each service and request an
appointment.

11
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:07.625
Projects track landscaping from planning through
maintenance, with organized stages and information.

12
00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:13.640
Plant species, materials, a schedule and a
two-dimensional plan help visualize the space.

13
00:01:14.642 --> 00:01:22.267
Rafinha keeps conversational context, analyzes photos
and searches sources when needed through an authorized
ChatGPT connection.

14
00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:29.917
His expressions follow the conversation. Each
installation uses its own account; developer credentials
are not included.

15
00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:37.808
The admin dashboard brings together revenue, sales,
ongoing projects and stock alerts.

16
00:01:37.808 --> 00:01:43.708
Metrics are calculated from stored data, with date
filters to monitor operations.

17
00:01:44.725 --> 00:01:49.850
Inventory and suppliers connect with orders, services
and financial records.

18
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:56.390
Revenue, expenses and reports help monitor the business
and review its transaction history.

19
00:01:57.392 --> 00:02:02.692
The Windows demo brings everything together in a local
application with fictional data.

20
00:02:02.692 --> 00:02:07.717
Discover Ateliê Verde in the portfolio and explore both
the customer and administrator experiences.
